ng for authentic Islamic knowledge, spiritual growth, or opportunities to serve humanity, you have found a community that shares your aspirations.</strong></h3><hr><h3><strong>What Defines Us</strong></h3><h3><strong>Authentic Da’wah: We are committed to the pristine teachings of the Qur’an and the Sunnah, providing structured learning through our circles of knowledge (<em>Halqahs</em>) and seminars.</strong></h3><h3><strong>Social Reform: From advocating for good governance to institutionalizing Zakat, we strive to build a society governed by justice and compassion.</strong></h3><h3><strong>Youth &amp; Professional Excellence: We empower the next generation with the tools to succeed in their careers while maintaining their Islamic identity.</strong></h3><h3><strong>Unity of the Ummah: We serve as a bridge, fostering brotherhood and collaboration across the diverse Muslim landscape in Nigeria.</strong></h3><h3><strong>Get Connected</strong></h3><p><strong>The Muslim Congress is more than an organization; it is a movement. Our TMC Connect portal is designed to bring our services closer to you—wherever you are in Nigeria or the diaspora.</strong></p><blockquote><p><strong><em>\"Let there arise out of you a group of people inviting to all that is good, enjoining Al-Ma\'ruf and forbidding Al-Munkar. And it is they who are the successful.\"</em> — (Qur’an 3:104)</strong></p></blockquote><p><strong>Join us today in our journey toward spiritual excellence and national development.<br></strong></p><p></p>','/uploads/cms/1773050670964-1771248204845-amir.jpg','',NULL,'<p><strong>By providing Islamic forum for education, reformation and collaboration, we set agenda for repositioning of the Ummah.</strong></p><p><br></p>','<p><strong>To be the foremost organisation guiding, influencing and setting agenda for societal reformation in line with Qur’an and Sunnah.</strong></p><p><br></p>','08152251802','Mon-Fri (9am to 4pm)','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/cms/slider/1773050495540-177125791